          </div>
          <h1>Bounded, reviewable, and verifiable agent work.</h1>
          <p class="landing-hero__lead">A curated library of advanced prompts and deterministic orchestration tools that resolves natural-language intent to the smallest coherent workflow needed for the outcome.</p>
          <div class="landing-hero__actions">
            <a class="button button--primary button--large" href="docs.html">Open Documentation</a>
            <a class="button button--secondary button--large" href="#about">Project background</a>
